OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMayor's emails to be searched in
OL,4,APalantir battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Sadiq Khan will have his texts and
OL,7,Femails searched as part of a legal
OL,8,Fbattle over the blocking of a #50m deal
OL,9,Fbetween the Metropolitan Police and
OL,10,Ftechnology firm Palantir, the High
OL,11,FCourt has been told.
OL,13,FPalantir is suing the Mayor's Office
OL,14,Ffor Policing and Crime (MOPAC) over its
OL,15,Fdecision in May to block the Met from
OL,16,Fagreeing to a two-year deal with the
OL,17,Ffirm.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
