OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMayor's emails to be searched in
OL,4,APalantir battle
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt a preliminary hearing, the court was
OL,7,Ftold Khan and more than a dozen other
OL,8,FMOPAC and City Hall officials would
OL,9,Fhave their digital communications,
OL,10,Fincluding WhatsApp messages and
OL,11,FMicrosoft Teams chats, searched for
OL,12,Fanything relevant to the legal battle.
OL,14,FThe hearing also dealt with a separate
OL,15,Fdemand by MOPAC to see Palantir's own
OL,16,Finternal documents, which the firm is
OL,17,Fresisting.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
